112991.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112991.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-02T18:00:31Z"},"body":"Previously, when the code completion popup could not fully fit either above or below the current line, the editor always defaulted to drawing it below. This caused the popup to be partially cut off in small editor windows.\r\n\r\nThis PR improves that behavior:\r\n- When the popup cannot fit both above and below, it now compare the available space on each side and choose the side with more room.\r\n- The popup's line count is then dynamically reduced based on the available space, to ensure the completion window never clips.\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe533f69-daef-45b8-8202-f122540559f1\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8fd72e2-a9b7-4769-a4a3-3ea05458c0a6\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112991/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"time